  "description": "Subject: Node Process Manager \u2013 Current Topology Configuration  \n\nThe manager is set up with a top\u2011level description of \u201cTop\u2011level process manager configuration\u201d. Heartbeat checks occur every **30\u202fseconds**, and the instance carries a weight of **10**. It is tied to the workers named **worker1** and **worker2**, and binary messages are allowed to pass through. The wrapper runs at **log level \u201cinfo\u201d**, with parent\u2011ping timeout **5000\u202fms**, parent\u2011ping interval **1000\u202fms**, child\u2011ping timeout **3000\u202fms**, and child\u2011ping interval **500\u202fms**. During startup the system executes **`node init.js`** in **/opt/init**, passing an initialization object `{ \"step\": \"prepare\" }`; this step is enabled. For graceful shutdown it runs **`node stop.js`** in **/opt/shutdown** (no extra init data) and, if a hard stop is required, it invokes **`kill -9 $(cat pidfile)`** from **/opt/shutdown_hard**. Both shutdown commands are enabled.  \n\nThe data pipeline defines a single spout called **sourceSpout**, described as \u201cGenerates data streams\u201d. It is a **module_class** located in **/opt/spouts** and launched with **`node source.js`**. The spout uses the **json** subtype, has a telemetry timeout of **5.0\u202fseconds**, and is currently enabled. Its initialization supplies a buffer size of **\"1024\"**. Downstream, the bolt named **processorBolt** (\u201cProcesses incoming data\u201d) is also a **module_class**, residing in **/opt/bolts** and started with **`node process.js`**. It operates with the **filter** subtype, a telemetry timeout of **10.0\u202fseconds**, and is allowed to run in parallel. The bolt receives its input from **sourceSpout** on the **default** stream and this connection is enabled; its own init object sets a threshold of **\"0.75\"**.  \n\nFinally, the environment variables for this deployment are: **ENV=production**, **MAX_RETRIES=5**, and **LOG_PATH=/var/log/nodepm**.",
  "reference_json": {
    "general": {
      "description": "Top-level process manager configuration",
      "heartbeat": 30,
      "weight": 10,
      "worker_affinity": [
        "worker1",
        "worker2"
      ],
      "pass_binary_messages": true,
      "wrapper": {
        "log_level": "info",
        "ping_parent_timeout": 5000,
        "ping_parent_interval": 1000,
        "ping_child_timeout": 3000,
        "ping_child_interval": 500
      },
      "initialization": [
        {
          "working_dir": "/opt/init",
          "cmd": "node init.js",
          "init": {
            "step": "prepare"
          },
          "disabled": false
        }
      ],
      "shutdown": [
        {
          "working_dir": "/opt/shutdown",
          "cmd": "node stop.js",
          "init": {},
          "disabled": false
        }
      ],
      "shutdown_hard": [
        {
          "working_dir": "/opt/shutdown_hard",
          "cmd": "kill -9 $(cat pidfile)",
          "init": {},
          "disabled": false
        }
      ]
    },
    "spouts": [
      {
        "name": "sourceSpout",
        "description": "Generates data streams",
        "type": "module_class",
        "disabled": false,
        "working_dir": "/opt/spouts",
        "cmd": "node source.js",
        "subtype": "json",
        "telemetry_timeout": 5.0,
        "init": {
          "bufferSize": "1024"
        }
      }
    ],
    "bolts": [
      {
        "name": "processorBolt",
        "description": "Processes incoming data",
        "type": "module_class",
        "disabled": false,
        "working_dir": "/opt/bolts",
        "cmd": "node process.js",
        "subtype": "filter",
        "telemetry_timeout": 10.0,
        "inputs": [
          {
            "source": "sourceSpout",
            "stream_id": "default",
            "disabled": false
          }
        ],
        "init": {
          "threshold": "0.75"
        },
        "allow_parallel": true
      }
    ],
    "variables": {
      "ENV": "production",
      "MAX_RETRIES": "5",
      "LOG_PATH": "/var/log/nodepm"
    }
  }
